    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croissant is an interactive clicker game where you need to click the croissant to earn more croissants. Incredible, isn't it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a good time and relax with simplistic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become first in the leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and complete the collection of all Croissants!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140+ Croissant skins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20+ Upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for mouse, keyboard and gamepad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content added regularly </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90+ Steam achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud save </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inventory and list to track the evolution of your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill Lo-Fi soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Croissant is a game about collecting skins, and not a game based on the principle of item resale, NFT, scam... We remind you that all skins are dropable in-game and that no skin has a limited duration.)</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croissant is an interactive clicker game where you need to click the croissant to earn more croissants. Incredible, isn't it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a good time and relax with simplistic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become first in the leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and complete the collection of all Croissants!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140+ Croissant skins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20+ Upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for mouse, keyboard and gamepad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content added regularly </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90+ Steam achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud save </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inventory and list to track the evolution of your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill Lo-Fi soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Croissant is a game about collecting skins, and not a game based on the principle of item resale, NFT, scam... We remind you that all skins are dropable in-game and that no skin has a limited duration.)</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Croissant is a clicker game, click the Croissant to gain even more Croissant and become the best in the leaderboard! By spending time on the game, or by clicking on the Croissant, you can obtain skins. Collect them or trade them to expand your collection.",
